{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act31side_level_act31side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act31side",
  "stageId": "act31side_08",
  "title": "种因",
  "storyCode": "HS-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act31side/level_act31side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "42eb3ba944e0e319e968cc1c84694ada136b4bff0ec6cd8e1e0271d4fd34ac1b",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "暗无天日。\n不知地深几许，没有半点阳光透进来，空气也凝重得仿佛能感受到穹顶的重量。\n这是一座陵墓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "啥情况......我回这来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喂，老东西，还活着么？我来看看你啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "低沉的声音",
      "text": "（喑哑的嘶吼）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前是一扇厚重的大门，声音是从门后传来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "睡了这么久，火气是半点都没少啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "别装模作样吓唬人了，在这里躺了这么长时间，你真的还剩下什么能耐吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "没啥子好怕的......吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "尚蜀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "这是哪座山头，怎么连块路牌都没有......不对，这是哪一年？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "看这路上两边的房子，像是没有移动地块的样子......怎么像是我刚来尚蜀的时候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "叮——当——\n一人正用绳子将自己悬在陡峭的山崖上，用一锤一凿在悬壁上刻下一行行字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喂——山上那兄弟，你做啥子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "你不认识我？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我为什么要认识你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "这整座尚蜀城都是在我的设计下建造出来的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喔，厉害厉害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "天灾就要来了，人都已经撤走了。但我建造的这些屋子，都要毁于这场天灾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "我不甘心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "靖炎五年，余至尚蜀，历三十载......《尚蜀城记》？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "我要把我建造这座城的过程全部刻在这山崖上，让后世亿兆百姓全部记得我的功绩！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "可是天灾马上就要来了哎，就算你不惜命，一道天雷劈下来，这座山头都不一定保得住，你这不是白费功夫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "管不了那么多了，我就只有这一个法子。要是没人知道我的作为，我还不如不活了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "哪有这样的人......行吧，你接着忙活，我不打扰了哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喂，山上这条路最后通到哪儿啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "土木天师",
      "text": "不知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "是你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "恳请先生赐剑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "要剑，做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "救人，报仇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我说过，我铸的剑很贵的，你用什么换？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "我的命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "又来......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......我应该已经拒绝了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你记不记恨我，当年用一把破铜烂铁就打发了你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......我在说什么，不过是个幻影。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "可是您偏偏还记得我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "只是惦记着电影剧本的原型故事......还是忍不住会想，要是当时真的送你一把好剑，故事结局会不会有什么不一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "像您这样神通广大、见识无数的人，又怎会对我这样的无名之辈抱有恻隐之心呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "区区一个人类的命，对您来说，确实太不值钱了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "也不能说得这么过分吧，我还是很喜欢你们人类的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "您看我们，就像看戏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "您的随性之举，就能为这出戏添一处奇景，改变无数人的命运。到兴起的时候，您甚至也想加入进来，唱上几句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "可戏里风景千万，唯独您不在戏中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "盲眼的少年剑客",
      "text": "您始终孤身一人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "真是，看走马灯这件事也能落到我的身上......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "乏了，这把剑是认真打的，你带走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "就让我看看，故事结局还有没有什么变数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "先生，有一个少年，托我一定在今年冬至日前，把这个包裹交给您。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "他不敢亲自来见我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老人",
      "text": "他应该，已经死了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "包裹是空的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "这是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "先生，在下恭候多时了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "等我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "在下有一事不解，请先生解惑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "说来听听。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "先生，今日我去城郊采风，见到河边栖着一只奇异的羽兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "我从来没见过那么漂亮的羽兽......我正要掏出纸笔来画，它却振翅一飞，消失不见了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "我再想凭记忆里的印象去描绘它，却无论如何画不出来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "力所不及的事，过去便过去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "对其他人来说，过去也便过去了。可我姑且还自诩是个画家......是画家，总还是想留下点什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "这些年来，也画了不少。总觉得只有画得够多，见过的风景够多，才算不枉这一生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "可我终于想明白了一个道理......画，到底是死物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "这是何意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "此时画下的风景，下一瞬便是过眼云烟。画得越多，越觉得自己的画微不足道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "这不是理所当然的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "人生年不满百，想看遍这片大地只能是奢望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "不......先生应该还是没有明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "这里有在下一幅拙作，还想请先生指点一二。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "这是画？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "这是我的画。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "这是我们肉眼凡胎，凡夫俗子，所见风景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "就算是您这样的先生，您所行所见的风景，比起这片大地千年间天翻地覆的变化，也不过是沧海一粟罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "先生，再好好看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阮先生",
      "text": "我们都只有这一夕的时间了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "长得真好......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "这些都是你种的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "是这里的人们种的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "就像你说的，我不能用我的能力来干涉这些庄稼的生长......总有一天我会消失不见的，但这里的人们还要生活很久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "真是辛苦你了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "好久不见，黍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "真奇怪，我那个弟弟也说，最近总会梦见你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "干嘛总是要惦记我呢......是不是人上了年纪，就容易怀念过去了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你也会打趣我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "生活在这里的人，都记得曾经有一位“神农”，总结了二十四节气，教给人们耕种的知识。还冒着生命危险，把万顷冻土开垦成良田。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "“神农”，我怎么担得起呢。明明是我们一起做过的事，你怎么好全推在我身上？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "过去这么久了，还分什么你我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "我只记得，在我像一个孩子一样漫无目的地游荡的时候，有一个人把我留在了身边，给了我一个“家”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "她告诉我，不必在意什么人兽有别。我可以......我应该像一个人一样活着。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "可我没有想到，你还留在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "这是我答应过你的。守护好这片土地，让更多的人能吃饱饭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "黍啊......你怨过我吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "一千年了，哪里谈得上是奉献呢？这分明是囚禁......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "哪怕你已经神识散尽，还要因为与这片土地的联系被困在这里，不得自由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "因为我犯下的一个错......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "我不会怨你......我只怨自己，最后没有替你去那趟北边的远行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "黍......你知道的，与你认识这么长时间，我从来没有一刻把你当作“神”，我甚至都快忘了这一回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "可直到最后与你分别的时候，我才意识到，我是有私心的，作为“人”的私心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "我想恳求你留下来，继续帮助这里的人们。我的无数同族，他们都需要你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "可我不确定，你会不会爱他们，就像对我一样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "恐怕，我让你失望了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "我们还是失败了，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "你最终还是没有找到种子，我也没能研究出可以种在源石土壤上的庄稼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "连这片土地，我们都没能保护下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "人定胜天......人什么时候真的胜过天呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "黍......你后悔吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "我说的这些，其实你早都知道的，对吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黍",
      "text": "是的，我都知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "你本不该在这里见到我......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "你只是残留在这个装置里的一缕意识，我是这一点意识的回忆。罔两问景，多么悲哀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "面目模糊的女性",
      "text": "我就是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奇妙的生物",
      "text": "嘎——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "你还在这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“自在”",
      "text": "我一直在你心里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "命犯贪嗔，贪生怕死。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "我都差点忘了，当时为什么会画你出来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "山高水遥无是处，无碍吾自在人间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "浑浑噩噩了许久，我竟然连这点清醒都丢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夕",
      "text": "谁说要画遍世间万物才算画家，画出一山一水，便是一山一水的境界。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "画家挥剑，层山尽起。\n我即为我。\n我见即万象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "喂，醒醒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "在片场睡过去，作为导演也太失职了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "困了就睡嘛......我们现在拍的是哪一部？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "《机械巨兽大战巨兽》。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "喔，这不是我压箱底的剧本吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是指离谱程度吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "我发誓，今年一定是最后一年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "嬉笑怒骂，皆成文章，传说志异，都是故事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "我说，小炎熔啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "......你为什么愿意陪我闹这么久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你答应我的传奇武器，什么时候给我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "你果然还是惦记这个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "要是哪天，我消失得无影无踪，再也找不到——你会想我不？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "真有那么一天，不会有人记得你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你造出来的武器，工具，城市，还有那些电影，全都会消失不见......你明知道这一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "说得对......我也不该在这见到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "是啊，说得没错。我折腾的这些玩意，说到底都是白费功夫。可忍不住，就是要找点乐子，留点念想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "东西留过，我也开心过，这就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "谢谢你啊，小炎熔。在罗德岛上有你陪着胡闹的这些日子，还挺开心的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "丢脸......明明是自己造出来的东西，还要反过来教训我一番。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "动不动让别人翻陈芝麻烂谷子的记忆，实在是件很矫情的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "够了吧，能从那团混沌中分出来，我们已经回答过那个问题了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "只是一颗心脏而已，就别妄想再收我们回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "老家伙，我们辛辛苦苦从暗无天日的陵墓里走出来，不是为了继续活在你的阴影下的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年",
      "text": "给我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
